    [
        {
            "type": "header",
            "bbox": [
                0.092,
                0.051,
                0.188,
                0.063
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "TD/561/Add.1"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.085,
                0.811,
                0.114
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "which we both reaffirm the fundamental values in which we believe and commit to reforms needed for the future.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.121,
                0.812,
                0.164
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "6. Our first shared value is that every human being must be able to live in dignity and overcome poverty. While many factors may contribute to this fundamental objective, we believe that economic development remains one of the most effective ones.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.171,
                0.813,
                0.258
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "7. We are convinced that any economic development must respect the natural limits of the planet. Our responsibility to future generations is to implement policies that guarantee a healthy and preserved environment. In this context, we call on Governments to ensure effective enforcement of regulations, to guarantee enabling conditions for the deployment of private initiatives and to engage in international cooperation to promote innovation, economic growth, social development and environmental protection.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.264,
                0.813,
                0.336
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "8. We reaffirm our conviction that trade and investments between countries are powerful drivers of economic development and prosperity, provided they take place within an established and respected framework. That is why a rules-based, fair, open, transparent, predictable, inclusive, non-discriminatory and equitable multilateral trading system is more indispensable than ever.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.341,
                0.813,
                0.457
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "9. Our conviction is that the creation of conditions of stability and well-being are necessary for peaceful and friendly relations among countries and that, within the multilateral system, cooperation between countries is essential for achieving peace. That is why we strongly call for a strengthening of the multilateral system with the United Nations at its core. While globally agreed frameworks, such as the 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development, must continue to be implemented with redoubled effort, we hereby affirm our commitment to work together to reform multilateralism and make it capable of responding to current and future challenges.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.186,
                0.463,
                0.813,
                0.52
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "10. With its knowledge and expertise built over sixty-one years, we count on UNCTAD, in coordination with other international organizations, to support our countries in the implementation of our joint commitment for a just and sustainable economic system for a new era.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
